//! Explicit production composition for an externally owned Chromium browser.
//!
//! Preparing this composition validates capability selection and one merged
//! resource plan without opening a socket, starting a task, spawning Node.js,
//! discovering a browser, downloading a browser, or launching Chrome. The
//! separate `attach` operation opens only the caller-supplied CDP WebSocket.

